  "title": "习近平在陕西省平利县考察脱贫攻坚情况",
  "date": "2020-04-21 16:49:46",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王静                        )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n习近平总书记21日来到陕西省安康市平利县老县镇，在锦屏社区、镇卫生院、中心小学和茶园考察当地脱贫攻坚等情况。（文字记者：张晓松 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰、燕雁、翟健岚）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/27/9566303213718311991.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/57/16661787132583542669.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/76/17516812733769915044.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/2/5566605374381278154.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/93/12119337890209219129.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/22/2345589688778900598.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/43/4910497115897649727.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/76/5364770570022294040.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/68/17687965239926050544.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/96/1376299900445854632.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/39/4788520518282335583.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200421/76/868